<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  SAMPLE EXCERPT in the DISA CCI List XML format, for tests and the demo only.

  It contains just the CCIs used by the synthetic sample checklists. Definitions
  are placeholders (not DISA's text). The NIST SP 800-53 references show the
  structure the parser reads; verify any mapping against the official list.

  For real work, download the current U_CCI_List.xml from DISA (Cyber Exchange,
  "Control Correlation Identifier (CCI)") and pass it to "stig-poam build" with
  the cci-list option. See README.md.
-->
